(7639933, 1240249, 3306, '<td valign="top">Now why didnt I think of that! You must have snuck into my office to take that picture. At least the chair is aseptically wrapped in disposable cellophane but it needs to be changed at least once every 5 years between patients. I love the bars on the window so the patient cannot escape! You must be a dentist or a very sick person to have thought of this!! All kidding aside, I enjoy your creativity and slightly wierd sense of humor!</td>', 'Now why didnt I think of that! You must have snuck into my office to take that picture. At least the chair is aseptically wrapped in disposable cellophane but it needs to be changed at least once every 5 years between patients. I love the bars on the window so the patient cannot escape! You must be a dentist or a very sick person to have thought of this!! All kidding aside, I enjoy your creativity and slightly wierd sense of humor!', '2019-08-30 08:26:27.000000', NULL, 1),
