(7640427, 1240290, 114285, '<td valign="top">I love the font and the shadow that it cast, how did you do that? Also I often save for web and not at maximum quality, I dont think it makes much difference does it? Ive won plenty of ribbons doing it that way.</td>', 'I love the font and the shadow that it cast, how did you do that? Also I often save for web and not at maximum quality, I dont think it makes much difference does it? Ive won plenty of ribbons doing it that way.', '2019-09-04 07:55:02.000000', NULL, 0),
