(7640433, 1240322, 2158, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pangurban:</b></div><hr/><i> Great image although there''s something a little disturbing about it! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Yes, it''s disturbing that he has to live that way. On two occasions while I was watching him (not taking photos) men started messing with him. One even tried to undo his belt. On neither occasion did he move an inch.</td>', 'Originally posted by Pangurban: Great image although there''s something a little disturbing about it!   Yes, it''s disturbing that he has to live that way. On two occasions while I was watching him (not taking photos) men started messing with him. One even tried to undo his belt. On neither occasion did he move an inch.', '2019-09-04 08:51:51.000000', NULL, 0),
