(7640439, 1240347, 114969, '<td valign="top">I love how everything looks so harmonious, even though everything wasn''t planned in advance. This is something I am totally incapable of, I am in awe. I also love the message here, pessimistic, but unfortunately realistic. Thanks for this much needed reminder, and congrats on the well deserved ribbon!</td>', 'I love how everything looks so harmonious, even though everything wasn''t planned in advance. This is something I am totally incapable of, I am in awe. I also love the message here, pessimistic, but unfortunately realistic. Thanks for this much needed reminder, and congrats on the well deserved ribbon!', '2019-09-04 09:05:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7640441, 1240335, 159196, '<td valign="top">Thank you for the lovely comments. It isn''t the same model - this is my younger son - had to balance the scales, equal opportunities and all that jazz. Also, as neither of them live at home any longer, I grab whichever one happens to be available/home for the weekend.</td>', 'Thank you for the lovely comments. It isn''t the same model - this is my younger son - had to balance the scales, equal opportunities and all that jazz. Also, as neither of them live at home any longer, I grab whichever one happens to be available/home for the weekend.', '2019-09-04 09:34:15.000000', NULL, 0),
