(7640454, 1240335, 114969, '<td valign="top">This is probably my favorite of the contest. It just looks like the real thing: no one would be surprised to see it in a library or a bookstore. True, the title could be a bit easier to read, or the compression artifacts could be taken care of, but still it is so efficient as a whole that these are relatively minor things in the end. Congrats on the ribbon, even if I expected it to be a blue one!</td>', 'This is probably my favorite of the contest. It just looks like the real thing: no one would be surprised to see it in a library or a bookstore. True, the title could be a bit easier to read, or the compression artifacts could be taken care of, but still it is so efficient as a whole that these are relatively minor things in the end. Congrats on the ribbon, even if I expected it to be a blue one!', '2019-09-04 12:05:54.000000', NULL, 0),
(7640460, 1240348, 114969, '<td valign="top">This is clearly one of the best entry. I love how cleverly the title is aligned with the skyscraper and the leg: a lesson in design indeed. Deserved a ribbon imho.</td>', 'This is clearly one of the best entry. I love how cleverly the title is aligned with the skyscraper and the leg: a lesson in design indeed. Deserved a ribbon imho.', '2019-09-04 13:08:01.000000', NULL, 0),
